            "review_title": "Review at Shun Yi Stone Pot Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Wendy L\n5 contributions\n0\nSuperb service & exceptionally kind restaurant manager!\nNov 2024 • Friends\nWe were looking for some plain congee at Saigon Centre. for our friend who was feeling unwell. The restaurant actually only had seafood or pork congee on their menu but the lady at the restaurant was so super kind. She got her kitchen to specially make a small portion of plain congee for us! Soooo super kind of her! Thank u and I’m sorry I forgot to ask for your name. Think u are a restaurant Manager. From the bottom of our hearts, THANK YOU!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 30, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
