            "review_title": "Review at Shun Yi Stone Pot Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Hayami Yuichi\nLondon, United Kingdom11 contributions\n0\nThis place has such good authentic Chinese food\nNov 2022 • Couples\nWe randomly stumbled on this place while looking for a Cantonese Restaurant to eat and I'm so glad we did. The food is traditional Chinese food and is all very delicious and tasty, all of the sea food is fresh and well cooked. The most impressed cuisine is Stone Pot, we ordered Sautéed Dried Seafood with Assorted Mushroom and Stewed Beef Tendons & Brisket with Radish in Casserole. Really delicious, the first time eating and remembering the taste of these two dishes forever. Will definitely come back to the restaurant\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 16, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
