            "review_title": "Review at Shun Yi Stone Pot Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Athene Huyng\n3 contributions\n0\nNew experience at Shun Yi restaurant!\nNov 2021\nThe staff attentively recommends a variety of delectable foods.\n\nMy impression is that 'Seafood Platter in Shun Yi Sauce' dish is served in a large bowl. I love the mild spicy mixed a little fat from peanuts blended of sauce.\n\nFurthermore, there is another dish that I would like to recommend to everyone 'Spare Ribs with Plum Sauce' with tender ribs combined sweet and sour sauce that makes I want to get more.\n\nI will return with my family the next time.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 10, 2022",
